sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: A display message is configured

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a display message<br>with the same id as the already configured one

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest (message.id = <Configured_Id>, message.priority = <Configured Priority>)
    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SetDisplayMessageRequest<br>- message.id <Configured_Id><br>- message.priority <Configured Priority>
